//denseproj
encoding=base8
scratchpad /
| Dense Example 3: Wayland / Labwc Desktop Environment Construction
| Demonstrating first-class DE Building Blocks:
| 1. Taskbar Panel Block (widgets: launcher, pager, tasks, tray, clock, sysstat, quicksettings)
| 2. Floating App Dock Block (autohide, pinned applications)
| 3. Wallpaper Manager Block (layer-shell background, fill mode)
| 4. Compositor Block (Labwc keybindings, window rules, snapping, workspace config)
| 5. Window / Foreign Toplevel Management (focus, minimize, maximize, close)
| 6. Notifications & OSD (volume, brightness, urgent toasts)
| 7. Exporting production-ready Labwc + Wayland environment configuration
\

global | imports /
labwc - LWC
wayland - WL
\
